  <StatCompression_SP_BodyPartHealth_Label>部位血量</StatCompression_SP_BodyPartHealth_Label>
  <StatCompression_SP_BodyPartHealth_BaselineTooltip>会影响每个部位的血量，Baseline基准值 是每个种族角色不吃任何增益时的基础血量，为方便起见我们将基准值视为1（也就是100%的意思，2表示双倍血量）。</StatCompression_SP_BodyPartHealth_BaselineTooltip>
  <StatCompression_SP_MeleeBaseDamage_Label>近战基础伤害</StatCompression_SP_MeleeBaseDamage_Label>
  <StatCompression_SP_RangedBaseDamage_Label>远程基础伤害</StatCompression_SP_RangedBaseDamage_Label>
  <StatCompression_SP_MeleeExtraDamage_Label>近战额外伤害</StatCompression_SP_MeleeExtraDamage_Label>
