  <StatCompression_SP_ExplosionDamage_Label>爆炸伤害</StatCompression_SP_ExplosionDamage_Label>
  <StatCompression_SP_OtherDamage_Label>其他基础伤害</StatCompression_SP_OtherDamage_Label>
  <StatCompression_SP_Damage_BaselineTooltip>基础伤害模块，Baseline 是装备、角色、物品的基础伤害值。比如拳击一下⑨点伤害。基础值视为9。</StatCompression_SP_Damage_BaselineTooltip>
  <StatCompression_SP_Damage_DirectionTooltip>基础伤害只支持压缩高于阈值的数值。</StatCompression_SP_Damage_DirectionTooltip>
  <StatCompression_SP_NaturalHealingFactor_Label>自然愈合系数</StatCompression_SP_NaturalHealingFactor_Label>
  <StatCompression_SP_RegenerationRate_Label>再生速率</StatCompression_SP_RegenerationRate_Label>
  <StatCompression_SP_TotalBleedFactor_Label>总流血系数</StatCompression_SP_TotalBleedFactor_Label>
  <StatCompression_SP_HungerRateFactor_Label>饥饿速率系数</StatCompression_SP_HungerRateFactor_Label>
  <StatCompression_SP_RestFallFactor_Label>休息下降系数</StatCompression_SP_RestFallFactor_Label>
  <StatCompression_SP_FoodPoisoningChanceFactor_Label>食物中毒概率系数</StatCompression_SP_FoodPoisoningChanceFactor_Label>
  <StatCompression_SP_HediffStageFactor_BaselineTooltip>这是Hediff（医疗状态）的字段，Baseline基准值 1 表示100%基础数值，2表示双倍数值。</StatCompression_SP_HediffStageFactor_BaselineTooltip>
  <StatCompression_SP_RegenerationRate_BaselineTooltip>再生的Baseline基准值 是根据 HP/天计算。通常的pawn为0HP/天，食尸鬼可能有100HP/天，甚至更高的数值。</StatCompression_SP_RegenerationRate_BaselineTooltip>
  <StatCompression_SP_HediffStage_DirectionTooltip>方向由字段语义固定：自然愈合和再生压缩过高数值；流血、饥饿、休息下降和食物中毒压缩过低数值。</StatCompression_SP_HediffStage_DirectionTooltip>
