  <StatCompression_AdvancedPreviewSummary>方向：{0}&#10;正数基准值：{1}&#10;触发值：{2}</StatCompression_AdvancedPreviewSummary>
  <StatCompression_AdvancedPreviewFormulaHigher>B = 正数基准值；T = B * 阈值；e = (属性值 - T) / B&#10;属性值 &lt;= T：结果 = 原值&#10;属性值 &gt; T：结果 = T + B * C(e)&#10;C(e) = {0}；实际 t = {1}</StatCompression_AdvancedPreviewFormulaHigher>
  <StatCompression_AdvancedPreviewFormulaLower>x = 属性值 / 基准值；r = 1 / x；h = 阈值；e = r - h&#10;r &lt;= h：结果 = 原值&#10;r &gt; h：结果 = 基准值 / (h + C(e))&#10;C(e) = {0}；实际 t = {1}</StatCompression_AdvancedPreviewFormulaLower>
  <StatCompression_AdvancedPreviewFormulaLowerDirect>B = 正数基准值；T = B * 阈值；e = (T - 属性值) / B&#10;属性值 &gt;= T：结果 = 原值&#10;属性值 &lt; T：结果 = T - B * C(e)&#10;C(e) = {0}；实际 t = {1}</StatCompression_AdvancedPreviewFormulaLowerDirect>
